# BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore for a named Dockerfile, so this
# applies only to Dockerfile.opennext. The repo has no root .dockerignore.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.open-next
**/.wrangler
**/dist
**/.turbo
.git
**/storybook-static
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.lighthouseci
**/screenshots
